OL,3,GNEWSASearch to find blind twin sisters
OL,4,Aa forever home
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn adoption charity based in Reading
OL,7,Fhas made an urgent appeal to find a
OL,8,Fpermanent home for "determined and
OL,9,Faffectionate" blind twin sisters.
OL,11,FParents And Children Together (PACT) is
OL,12,Fsearching for an adoptive family for
OL,13,FLily and Rose, whose names have been
OL,14,Fchanged to protect their identities.
OL,16,FThe charity said the identical twins,
OL,17,Fwho are nearly 22-months-old, are
OL,18,Fregistered blind and have additional
OL,19,Fneeds. One of the twins also has
OL,20,Fepilepsy, which is well managed with
OL,21,Fmedication.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
